  ('src-ford-2025-rv-guide', 'towing_guide', 'https://www.ford.com/cmslibs/content/dam/brand_ford/en_us/brand/resources/general/pdf/guides/2025_Ford_RV_Trailer_Towing_Guide.pdf', '2025 Ford RV & Trailer Towing Guide', 'Ford Motor Company', 2024, '20-25', 'F-150 Conventional Towing', 'source_unavailable', '2024-11-15', 'TowingSpecs Automotive Verification Team', 'Specifications recorded from official 2025 publication (pages 20–25). Direct DAM link is undergoing repair; verified via Ford Towing Support portal (https://www.ford.com/support/category/towing/).'),
