  ('src-ford-2025-explorer', 'spec_sheet', 'https://media.ford.com/content/dam/fordmedia/North%20America/US/product/2025/explorer/2025-Ford-Explorer-Tech-Specs.pdf', '2025 Ford Explorer Technical Specifications', 'Ford Motor Company', 2024, '4', 'Capacities & Towing', 'source_unavailable', '2024-10-10', 'TowingSpecs Automotive Verification Team', 'Media tech specs URL redirects to consumer marketing homepage (HTTP 302). Specifications recorded from 2025 Ford Explorer documentation (Class III Trailer Tow Package required for 5,000 lbs rating), but source document is unavailable pending OEM asset relink.'),
