  ('src-chevy-2025-tahoe', 'spec_sheet', 'https://media.chevrolet.com/content/dam/media/us/en/chevrolet/vehicles/tahoe/2025/2025-chevrolet-tahoe-specifications.pdf', '2025 Chevrolet Tahoe Technical Specifications', 'General Motors', 2024, '3', 'Trailering & Capacities', 'source_unavailable', '2024-11-22', 'TowingSpecs Automotive Verification Team', 'Specifications recorded from official 2025 publication (page 3). Direct DAM link is undergoing repair; verified via Chevrolet Owners Manual portal (https://www.chevrolet.com/owners/manuals).'),
