  ('src-toyota-2025-crown-signia', 'spec_sheet', 'https://pressroom.toyota.com/vehicle/2025-toyota-crown-signia/', '2025 Toyota Crown Signia Product Specifications & Capacity Sheet', 'Toyota Motor Sales, U.S.A., Inc.', 2024, 'Capacities & Dimensions', 'Towing Specifications', 'manufacturer_verified', '2024-10-15', 'TowingSpecs Automotive Verification Team', 'Official manufacturer release for new 2025 Crown Signia. Standard Electronic On-Demand AWD with 2,700 lb towing rating under SAE J2807 testing.'),
  ('src-toyota-2024-venza', 'owner_manual', 'https://www.toyota.com/owners/resources/warranty-owners-manuals', '2024 Toyota Venza Owner''s Manual', 'Toyota Motor Sales, U.S.A., Inc.', 2023, '184', 'Driving Information — Trailer Towing', 'partially_verified', '2024-10-15', 'TowingSpecs Automotive Verification Team', 'Generic Toyota warranty and owners manual search portal requiring VIN lookup. Does not link directly to 2024 Venza Owner Manual Section 4-1 (page 184) where 0 lbs capacity ("Toyota does not recommend towing a trailer") is stated; demoted to partially_verified pending direct document link.'),
  ('src-toyota-2021-tacoma', 'brochure', 'https://www.toyota.com/owners/resources/warranty-owners-manuals', '2021 Toyota Tacoma eBrochure & Towing Guide', 'Toyota Motor Sales, U.S.A., Inc.', 2020, 'Features & Specifications', 'Towing Package Ratings', 'partially_verified', '2024-10-15', 'TowingSpecs Automotive Verification Team', 'Official 2021 Toyota Tacoma specifications. Documents 3.5L V6 Tow Prep (Class IV hitch, ATF cooler, engine oil cooler, 130A alternator) at 6,400 lbs vs 2.7L I4 at 3,500 lbs.'),
  ('src-toyota-2021-tundra', 'brochure', 'https://www.toyota.com/owners/resources/warranty-owners-manuals', '2021 Toyota Tundra eBrochure & Towing Matrix', 'Toyota Motor Sales, U.S.A., Inc.', 2020, 'Dimensions & Capacities', '5.7L V8 SAE J2807 Compliance', 'partially_verified', '2024-10-15', 'TowingSpecs Automotive Verification Team', 'Final model year for 2nd generation 5.7L i-FORCE V8 Tundra. Standard heavy-duty tow package certified under SAE J2807.'),
