  ('src-subaru-2024-ascent', 'spec_sheet', 'https://media.subaru.com/pressreleases.do?search=2024+Ascent+specs', '2024 Subaru Ascent Technical Specifications', 'Subaru of America, Inc.', 2023, 'Capacities & Equipment', 'Trailer Towing System', 'partially_verified', '2024-10-18', 'TowingSpecs Automotive Verification Team', 'Dynamic press release search query URL rather than a permanent document citation. Ratings recorded from Subaru technical release (Base trim 2,000 lbs; Premium, Limited, Onyx, and Touring 5,000 lbs with standard transmission oil cooler); demoted to partially_verified pending permanent document permalink.'),
